<% layout('layout') -%><section class="page-heading"><h1>Privacy notice — starter template</h1><p>This document must be reviewed by qualified counsel before public launch.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2>Data collected</h2><p>Booking requests can contain names, phone numbers, postal codes, parcel descriptions and shipment status. Collect only what is necessary and explain why it is needed.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Define a documented retention period and a verified process for data access and deletion. Legal and carrier requirements may require limited records to be retained.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>Use verified access controls, encryption in transit, restricted database access, backups and private media storage. Do not upload secrets to GitHub.</p></section>
